        <mxCell id="footer_note" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#B3B3B3;fillColor=#FFF2CC;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#333333;" value="Architectural Flow Key:&#xa;• Write Path: EventBridge triggers Glue Python Shell to fetch API data from data.gov.sg. Processed Parquet files are written directly to S3 via S3 Gateway Endpoint, and table definitions are updated via Glue Interface Endpoint.&#xa;• Read Path: Tableau Server queries Athena via Athena Interface Endpoint across VPC Peering. Athena checks Glue Data Catalog schema definitions and reads Parquet files from Amazon S3." vertex="1">
